WEBVTT

00:01.610 --> 00:02.947
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:02.971 --> 00:04.306
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.330 --> 00:07.546
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.570 --> 00:13.130
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.130 --> 01:31.090
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.250 --> 01:34.490
=Episode 19=

01:35.040 --> 01:39.865
(Mushan Hall)

02:15.115 --> 02:16.665
Lord is known for elegance.

02:16.689 --> 02:19.090
You do live up to your reputation.

02:23.129 --> 02:25.930
Fengnian, there are no strangers here.

02:26.840 --> 02:29.440
You may just call me Uncle.

02:36.365 --> 02:38.330
My greetings, Uncle.

02:39.840 --> 02:42.770
You are just like your father.

02:44.065 --> 02:45.490
My son

02:45.915 --> 02:47.990
is way inferior to you.

02:50.090 --> 02:51.849
I'm flattered.

02:52.365 --> 02:53.985
You had a misunderstanding

02:54.009 --> 02:56.729
with my son on Chunshen Lake.

02:57.840 --> 02:59.765
He feels embarrassed

03:00.140 --> 03:01.170
to meet you.

03:01.915 --> 03:04.315
So, I came with his mother.

03:04.690 --> 03:05.969
Sorry for it.

03:08.340 --> 03:09.715
Don't you apologize?

03:25.365 --> 03:26.969
My apology, Xu.

03:38.165 --> 03:39.490
It's a misunderstanding.

03:39.849 --> 03:42.090
I don't deserve your apology.

03:44.290 --> 03:45.849
Fengnian is tolerant.

03:47.890 --> 03:49.969
He has forgiven you.

04:13.015 --> 04:13.566
Hey.

04:13.590 --> 04:14.590
Where are you going, sir?

04:15.090 --> 04:16.129
To the street.

04:16.840 --> 04:17.890
Now?

04:18.740 --> 04:19.980
Lord of Jing'an and Xu Fengnian

04:20.065 --> 04:20.942
are all sly.

04:20.966 --> 04:22.210
Don't worry about them.

04:36.015 --> 04:37.640
Lord of Jing'an is in that yard.

04:39.640 --> 04:41.015
Would you go for revenge?

04:41.490 --> 04:43.010
You don't need to stay with me.

04:43.240 --> 04:44.665
I won't be impulsive.

04:45.815 --> 04:47.049
Now I only live

04:49.215 --> 04:51.640
to guard Xu Fengnian.

05:03.890 --> 05:05.810
You're devout indeed,

05:07.315 --> 05:08.490
praying every day.

05:09.015 --> 05:10.529
You must be blessed by Bodhisattva.

05:11.715 --> 05:13.615
I only wish

05:13.865 --> 05:16.015
for good karma.

05:23.640 --> 05:24.640
By the way,

05:25.365 --> 05:27.849
I heard that you moved

05:28.740 --> 05:30.940
to Mushan Island days ago.

05:34.690 --> 05:35.969
Yes, for one night.

05:36.090 --> 05:37.306
Oh.

05:39.015 --> 05:41.040
Wang Linquan on the island

05:41.289 --> 05:43.169
is my favorite general.

05:44.665 --> 05:45.915
Surprisingly,

05:46.840 --> 05:48.289
you're close to him.

05:49.565 --> 05:51.740
You have friends everywhere indeed.

05:54.315 --> 05:55.440
To be honest,

05:57.390 --> 05:59.290
he once served in the army.

06:00.440 --> 06:01.840
He is my senior.

06:02.440 --> 06:03.440
Oh.

06:04.690 --> 06:06.215
I see.

06:08.165 --> 06:11.540
He may stay
for a few more days with you.

06:11.790 --> 06:13.289
He can come back for duty

06:13.540 --> 06:16.165
after you leave.

06:16.565 --> 06:18.640
Sorry, Uncle.

06:19.840 --> 06:21.929
He worked for North Liang before.

06:22.740 --> 06:25.090
He should be back to North Liang.

06:26.690 --> 06:28.066
That's where he belongs.

06:28.090 --> 06:29.330
Right?

06:33.415 --> 06:35.090
You have a point.

06:40.265 --> 06:41.849
Is it your father's will?

06:43.090 --> 06:44.330
I have the say

06:45.165 --> 06:47.130
on this trivial matter.

06:51.115 --> 06:53.890
North Liang is a fair land.

06:55.165 --> 06:56.169
You are

06:56.390 --> 06:59.010
already the pride of your family,

06:59.915 --> 07:02.010
way better than my son.

07:03.165 --> 07:05.210
Qingzhou is even better.

07:06.415 --> 07:07.865
Especially my aunt.

07:08.390 --> 07:09.665
She's so beautiful.

07:13.815 --> 07:15.489
Aunt, do you also believe in Buddhism?

07:22.365 --> 07:24.250
Our nephew is asking you.

07:24.365 --> 07:26.115
You should reply.

07:29.015 --> 07:30.015
Yes,

07:30.265 --> 07:31.265
I do.

07:32.890 --> 07:34.215
In that case,

07:34.965 --> 07:37.790
I'm supposed to give you a bracelet.

07:39.740 --> 07:40.740
No, thanks.

07:41.115 --> 07:42.145
It shows my care.

07:42.169 --> 07:43.409
Please accept it.

07:45.315 --> 07:47.165
It's a kind gift from Fengnian.

07:47.615 --> 07:48.840
Don't refuse it.

07:51.965 --> 07:52.965
Yes.

07:55.640 --> 07:56.586
One-armed old man!

07:56.610 --> 07:57.705
Give it back to me!

07:57.729 --> 07:58.386
One-armed old man!

07:58.410 --> 07:59.866
Give it back to me!

07:59.890 --> 08:00.666
One-armed old man!

08:00.690 --> 08:01.306
Give it back!

08:01.330 --> 08:02.106
One-armed old man!

08:02.130 --> 08:02.885
(Longevity)
Give me the pinwheel!

08:02.909 --> 08:03.966
- Wait a minute.
- One-armed old man!

08:03.990 --> 08:04.891
Give me the pinwheel!

08:04.915 --> 08:05.705
Take it.

08:05.729 --> 08:06.385
Go. Go.

08:06.409 --> 08:07.141
Hurry.

08:07.165 --> 08:07.917
Wait for me.

08:07.941 --> 08:09.090
Hey, lass.

08:11.365 --> 08:12.365
What a coincidence.

08:13.615 --> 08:15.815
(Longevity)

08:17.140 --> 08:18.169
I asked.

08:18.465 --> 08:19.690
Coffins' price goes up again.

08:20.465 --> 08:22.215
I can't even afford a coffin.

08:25.015 --> 08:27.250
Do you wanna die so young?

08:27.915 --> 08:29.145
We're born to die.

08:29.169 --> 08:30.391
You won't fear death
when you see everything through.

08:30.415 --> 08:31.415
Be my disciple

08:31.440 --> 08:32.810
and no one will let you die.

08:35.565 --> 08:36.565
Look.

08:36.815 --> 08:38.565
Isn't it Mr. Wang?

08:39.765 --> 08:40.390
Yeah.

08:40.740 --> 08:41.740
It's him.

08:42.090 --> 08:43.565
He's in a hurry.

08:54.140 --> 08:55.140
My lord.

09:05.865 --> 09:06.865
Go.

09:20.290 --> 09:22.515
There's something in my mansion.

09:22.765 --> 09:23.765
Fengnian.

09:24.490 --> 09:25.490
See you

09:26.390 --> 09:27.765
some other day.

09:27.940 --> 09:29.530
See you, Uncle.

09:37.265 --> 09:38.866
When I get a bracelet,

09:38.890 --> 09:40.810
I'll have it delivered to your mansion.

10:09.415 --> 10:11.666
I saw Wang Linquan in the street.

10:11.690 --> 10:12.945
But he didn't come to the inn.

10:12.969 --> 10:14.609
He went to the Mansion
of Lord of Jing'an.

10:16.540 --> 10:19.015
Did Wang Linquan change his mind?

10:21.489 --> 10:22.530
There's no turning back.

10:22.590 --> 10:23.590
What?

10:35.489 --> 10:36.147
Does your father know

10:36.171 --> 10:37.249
you've come here?

10:39.365 --> 10:40.849
What is it to do with you?

10:41.040 --> 10:43.290
It's urgent. Please tell me.

10:46.790 --> 10:47.840
He doesn't.

10:50.015 --> 10:51.495
Is there a way back to Mushan Island?

10:52.009 --> 10:52.666
Who's going back?

10:52.690 --> 10:53.690
You and I.

10:56.040 --> 10:57.666
The ships are all kept by my father.

10:57.690 --> 10:59.506
You can ask him for help.

10:59.530 --> 11:00.290
No.

11:00.415 --> 11:02.450
He can't know it. We'll go back alone.

11:04.790 --> 11:05.849
What are you going to do?

11:08.190 --> 11:09.190
Your father

11:09.490 --> 11:11.050
went to the Mansion of Lord of Jing'an.

11:16.315 --> 11:17.609
Do you suspect my father?

11:17.990 --> 11:19.165
Have you ever thought about

11:19.540 --> 11:20.392
why your father received us

11:20.416 --> 11:21.969
with great fanfare?

11:23.415 --> 11:24.945
In the long run,

11:24.969 --> 11:26.530
that he hides his identity

11:26.765 --> 11:28.040
is better for North Liang.

11:30.540 --> 11:31.540
Moreover,

11:32.365 --> 11:33.625
why did he insist on getting you

11:33.649 --> 11:34.715
by my side?

11:36.565 --> 11:37.810
Do you know it?

11:40.390 --> 11:42.009
He wants to save your life.

11:43.365 --> 11:44.410
What?

11:51.290 --> 11:52.815
Xu Fengnian went too far.

11:55.040 --> 11:55.889
Father.

11:55.940 --> 11:58.090
Why does Wang Linquan
have the guts to see you?

12:00.140 --> 12:02.330
It's Xu Xiao's idea.

12:02.990 --> 12:03.990
Xu Xiao?

12:04.290 --> 12:06.190
Xu Fengnian is young after all.

12:07.115 --> 12:08.565
He made it clear

12:08.815 --> 12:10.140
just now.

12:11.465 --> 12:12.665
He wanted

12:12.915 --> 12:15.065
Wang Linquan and his family

12:15.440 --> 12:16.840
to move back to North Liang.

12:19.140 --> 12:20.765
Wang Linquan has exposed himself.

12:20.965 --> 12:21.965
He has to go.

12:22.615 --> 12:24.165
If Wang Linquan leaves,

12:24.665 --> 12:25.745
Xu Fengnian

12:25.769 --> 12:27.210
will not be able to leave.

12:28.490 --> 12:30.090
It looks like

12:30.240 --> 12:32.170
I'm in a dilemma.

12:32.665 --> 12:33.985
If I let Xu Fengnian go,

12:34.009 --> 12:35.530
the court will suspect that

12:35.865 --> 12:37.440
I have allied with North Liang.

12:38.740 --> 12:40.065
If I kill Xu Fengnian,

12:40.565 --> 12:42.410
Xu Xiao will retaliate.

12:43.340 --> 12:44.440
But in fact,

12:45.890 --> 12:48.530
Xu Xiao has left us a way

12:48.940 --> 12:50.665
to satisfy both sides.

12:54.265 --> 12:55.390
Keep the Wang family?

12:57.540 --> 12:58.540
Exactly.

12:59.365 --> 13:01.541
Wang Linquan has exposed himself

13:01.565 --> 13:03.190
as North Liang's spy.

13:04.090 --> 13:06.050
If we keep his family in Qingzhou,

13:06.615 --> 13:07.930
the court will

13:08.165 --> 13:09.849
know our stance.

13:10.415 --> 13:13.369
If the relations between Qingzhou
and North Liang are strained,

13:13.840 --> 13:15.015
the court

13:15.540 --> 13:17.965
will make Xu Xiao see His Majesty.

13:20.165 --> 13:21.765
To reassure the court,

13:22.265 --> 13:23.565
keeping the Wang family

13:23.990 --> 13:24.990
may not be enough.

13:26.190 --> 13:27.190
Right.

13:28.715 --> 13:30.540
To clarity our stance,

13:31.690 --> 13:33.465
the Wang family must be wiped out.

13:37.165 --> 13:38.810
Is this also Xu Xiao's plan?

13:40.415 --> 13:41.849
Otherwise, why do you think

13:42.140 --> 13:43.740
Wang Linquan

13:43.915 --> 13:46.050
exposed his identity openly?

13:48.665 --> 13:50.969
Since he received Xu Fengnian
to the island,

13:51.489 --> 13:52.570
he's been ready

13:52.609 --> 13:55.570
to sacrifice all his family.

13:57.015 --> 13:58.440
Getting his subordinate's family

13:58.889 --> 14:00.615
all killed,

14:01.865 --> 14:03.410
Xu Xiao is cruel.

14:03.940 --> 14:06.410
If he can't even do this,

14:07.615 --> 14:10.790
he's not eligible for this game.

14:13.715 --> 14:14.715
That's impossible.

14:15.240 --> 14:16.426
Otherwise, why did your father

14:16.450 --> 14:17.450
urge you to go with me?

14:19.215 --> 14:20.940
That's the way to save my life.

14:21.365 --> 14:22.715
He's your father.

14:26.249 --> 14:27.790
It's part of your father's plan

14:28.129 --> 14:29.965
that our family will be sacrificed!

14:33.065 --> 14:34.465
Only if we go back to Mushan Island

14:34.640 --> 14:35.940
can I save your family.

14:36.740 --> 14:37.626
I never play a game

14:37.650 --> 14:39.665
as per others' rules.

14:47.515 --> 14:48.105
Fine.

14:48.129 --> 14:49.129
Let's go.

14:49.890 --> 14:50.842
You guys stay.

14:50.866 --> 14:52.465
Don't let anyone know I've left here.

14:52.489 --> 14:53.570
I'll be right back.

14:53.940 --> 14:55.500
If you decided to save the Wang family,

14:55.740 --> 14:57.415
how will you leave Qingzhou?

15:00.765 --> 15:02.050
I won't take Xu Xiao's way.

15:03.740 --> 15:05.790
I will make

15:06.715 --> 15:08.190
a way of my own.

15:24.515 --> 15:26.740
Serve tea to Mr. Wang.

15:30.115 --> 15:31.765
I don't dare to bother Her Highness.

15:34.415 --> 15:35.649
For so many years,

15:35.930 --> 15:37.065
you've done me

15:37.565 --> 15:39.369
a lot of favor.

15:41.015 --> 15:42.765
You deserve this cup of tea.

16:09.249 --> 16:10.390
Thank you, my lord.

16:13.240 --> 16:14.590
I come to beg you

16:15.865 --> 16:18.450
to let His Highness go east.

16:19.649 --> 16:20.649
I believe

16:21.615 --> 16:23.729
you've known everything.

16:25.340 --> 16:26.590
Some people leave.

16:27.590 --> 16:29.165
Some people must stay.

16:30.965 --> 16:31.990
I'll stay.

16:35.165 --> 16:36.440
You alone

16:36.665 --> 16:38.609
can't exchange for Xu Fengnian.

16:42.849 --> 16:44.340
My daughter is young.

16:46.165 --> 16:48.665
Please spare her life.

16:49.515 --> 16:50.649
Except for her,

16:51.540 --> 16:54.440
all my family will stay in Qingzhou.

16:55.390 --> 16:56.965
Since it's all your family,

16:57.665 --> 16:59.090
no one shall be spared.

17:14.570 --> 17:15.570
Fine.

17:18.165 --> 17:20.065
As you wish, my lord.

17:21.090 --> 17:22.490
I'll go back to the island

17:23.865 --> 17:24.970
and move my family

17:26.865 --> 17:28.209
to Xiangfan.

17:31.290 --> 17:32.515
Upon your arrival,

17:32.665 --> 17:34.115
I'll have men

17:34.290 --> 17:36.649
escort Xu Fengnian out of Qingzhou.

17:48.590 --> 17:49.815
Don't you hate Xu Xiao?

17:58.315 --> 18:01.240
You know nothing about
North Liang's army!

18:11.440 --> 18:13.190
It's the will of the people

18:14.665 --> 18:16.770
that makes North Liang formidable.

18:21.765 --> 18:23.265
You may leave

18:24.040 --> 18:25.369
and think about it.

18:47.615 --> 18:48.690
Tea.

19:13.090 --> 19:14.090
Get up!

19:18.490 --> 19:20.290
How shameless you are!

19:20.515 --> 19:23.490
Would you be captivated by him

19:24.240 --> 19:26.015
if you talked more with him?

19:37.515 --> 19:40.050
You think I don't know
he touched your hand?

19:42.265 --> 19:43.590
You shrew!

19:44.165 --> 19:45.929
You feel happy in your heart,

19:46.640 --> 19:47.640
right?

19:49.530 --> 19:50.565
I'm a shrew.

19:51.515 --> 19:52.876
I don't deserve to be your wife.

20:10.915 --> 20:11.929
Pei Nanwei.

20:13.640 --> 20:14.765
Did I hurt you?

20:18.190 --> 20:19.190
No.

20:24.990 --> 20:26.640
You hate me.

20:27.940 --> 20:29.615
Why don't you die?

20:42.315 --> 20:43.330
I feared death.

20:44.440 --> 20:45.570
That's why I married you.

20:48.640 --> 20:49.640
Get out!

21:56.090 --> 21:57.390
If you had cried for mercy,

21:59.590 --> 22:00.915
he might've stopped.

22:02.440 --> 22:03.540
Thank you, Your Highness.

22:31.915 --> 22:32.915
There is no boat here.

22:33.740 --> 22:34.905
I've told you

22:34.929 --> 22:36.016
my father kept all the boats.

22:36.040 --> 22:37.200
How will we go to the island?

22:41.250 --> 22:42.026
Miss Wang.

22:42.050 --> 22:42.987
We should hurry.

22:43.011 --> 22:44.609
We must be back before your father.

22:56.265 --> 22:57.515
We can go without the boat.

23:00.965 --> 23:01.965
Is this

23:03.565 --> 23:04.565
Yuan?

23:04.940 --> 23:06.240
You are knowledgeable.

23:06.490 --> 23:07.516
I thought it was a turtle

23:07.540 --> 23:08.865
when I first saw it.

23:16.090 --> 23:17.090
What are you waiting for?

23:17.115 --> 23:18.115
Come up.

24:01.165 --> 24:01.915
Stop looking.

24:02.165 --> 24:03.165
There's no word.

24:05.190 --> 24:06.515
Where did you find Yuan?

24:07.065 --> 24:08.691
By a lake when I was little.

24:08.715 --> 24:09.790
Then we got familiar.

24:13.265 --> 24:14.970
It couldn't be born with a monolith.

24:15.140 --> 24:17.290
Yuan might have a story.

24:18.415 --> 24:20.390
Why don't you ask it?

24:21.215 --> 24:22.215
Can it talk?

24:22.240 --> 24:22.842
Yeah.

24:22.866 --> 24:24.065
It can also recite poems.

24:25.765 --> 24:27.865
Are you still in a mood to joke?

24:28.490 --> 24:30.140
Better than wearing a long face.

24:31.465 --> 24:32.465
Right.

24:36.190 --> 24:38.506
Black! Let's go back to the island.

24:38.530 --> 24:39.865
We need to save people!

24:49.540 --> 24:51.015
Did you name it Black?

24:51.690 --> 24:52.841
It's so black.

24:52.865 --> 24:54.570
Black is a perfect name for it.

24:57.315 --> 24:58.970
Don't let anyone know

24:59.115 --> 25:00.330
you can summon Yuan.

25:01.090 --> 25:02.515
Or you'll be in trouble.

25:03.740 --> 25:04.740
I know.

25:05.415 --> 25:07.090
If it weren't urgent,

25:07.340 --> 25:08.770
I wouldn't have let you know.

25:09.265 --> 25:10.265
Don't worry.

25:10.390 --> 25:11.465
I won't tell anyone.

25:20.740 --> 25:22.169
Why do you save my family?

25:26.740 --> 25:28.440
Do you need any reason to save people?

25:30.140 --> 25:31.790
Your father planed everything.

25:32.290 --> 25:33.970
Now you're disrupting it.

25:34.540 --> 25:36.490
Lord of Jing'an will have
no turning back.

25:37.515 --> 25:39.290
Isn't it hard for you to leave Qingzhou?

25:42.265 --> 25:43.265
Yes.

25:44.915 --> 25:45.915
I know it.

25:46.165 --> 25:47.490
As long as I steeled myself

25:47.815 --> 25:49.449
and followed Xu Xiao's plan,

25:50.640 --> 25:51.849
I could leave safely.

25:54.940 --> 25:56.090
But sometimes,

25:57.290 --> 25:58.590
we should be foolish.

25:59.915 --> 26:01.690
Isn't it better to be smart?

26:06.840 --> 26:08.849
I used to travel for three years

26:10.290 --> 26:11.290
with a friend,

26:12.990 --> 26:14.169
Wen Hua.

26:15.090 --> 26:16.169
A swordsman.

26:17.840 --> 26:18.890
Was he good?

26:19.365 --> 26:20.640
I've never heard about him.

26:22.440 --> 26:24.570
He had a wooden sword with him,

26:24.665 --> 26:25.970
and never

26:26.615 --> 26:27.730
won a fight.

26:28.515 --> 26:29.515
Wooden sword?

26:31.265 --> 26:32.265
He was too poor

26:32.565 --> 26:33.965
to buy a true sword.

26:35.865 --> 26:37.715
How come you had such a friend?

26:38.440 --> 26:40.530
Back then Old Huang and I were
even poorer.

26:41.065 --> 26:42.425
We met him when stealing chickens,

26:42.515 --> 26:43.515
and ran away together.

26:44.090 --> 26:45.490
Then we became friends.

26:47.615 --> 26:49.090
Wen Hua

26:50.690 --> 26:51.840
did many filthy things

26:52.340 --> 26:53.665
like pilfering.

26:55.240 --> 26:56.929
His clothes were always shabby.

26:57.215 --> 26:58.215
His face

26:58.390 --> 26:59.530
was dirty.

27:00.365 --> 27:01.546
He always boasted that

27:01.570 --> 27:02.307
he'd be

27:02.331 --> 27:03.810
a top swordsman.

27:05.915 --> 27:07.490
But no swordsman is like him.

27:07.590 --> 27:08.590
You're right.

27:09.740 --> 27:10.900
I said the same thing to him.

27:13.540 --> 27:15.090
Why did you bring him up?

27:19.265 --> 27:20.265
We once traveled together

27:20.690 --> 27:21.889
on the journey.

27:24.765 --> 27:26.409
At the worst of times,

27:27.365 --> 27:28.445
we nearly starved to death.

27:29.715 --> 27:31.241
Someone offered him 100 taels of silver

27:31.265 --> 27:32.369
to kill people.

27:33.690 --> 27:34.690
Did he do it?

27:36.040 --> 27:37.290
No, he threw the money away.

27:38.040 --> 27:39.590
Was his target an innocent person?

27:41.615 --> 27:42.790
I asked him

27:43.590 --> 27:44.915
why he didn't accept the money

27:45.565 --> 27:47.040
since he was starving.

27:47.840 --> 27:49.040
Anyway, swordsmen

27:49.540 --> 27:50.590
were killers.

27:51.090 --> 27:52.140
What did he say?

27:54.190 --> 27:55.190
He said,

27:57.915 --> 27:59.290
a swordsman

28:01.065 --> 28:02.065
might be slovenly

28:03.465 --> 28:04.465
or sloppy,

28:05.965 --> 28:08.689
but he must have a good heart.

28:10.565 --> 28:11.625
If a swordsman killed the innocent

28:11.649 --> 28:13.115
solely to survive,

28:14.865 --> 28:16.449
he wouldn't deserve a sword.

28:21.115 --> 28:22.929
He was foolish, wasn't he?

28:23.140 --> 28:24.889
He had nothing but a wooden sword.

28:26.265 --> 28:27.265
Not very much.

28:31.215 --> 28:32.215
I'm foolish as well.

28:32.440 --> 28:33.689
I listened and agreed with him.

28:36.740 --> 28:37.740
So,

28:38.390 --> 28:40.169
you don't want to sacrifice my family

28:40.940 --> 28:41.747
because

28:41.771 --> 28:43.369
you want to be clean in your heart.

28:46.090 --> 28:47.990
I might not be a swordsman,

28:48.715 --> 28:50.390
but I wanna be a good person.

28:52.215 --> 28:54.145
Wen Hua said, what he feared the most

28:54.169 --> 28:55.169
was to feel guilty.

28:55.740 --> 28:57.026
So, I don't wanna choose

28:57.050 --> 28:58.050
or compromise.

28:59.865 --> 29:02.140
I only do what I think is right.

29:04.390 --> 29:05.490
Yes, you're foolish.

29:05.940 --> 29:07.625
I wonder how a person like you

29:07.649 --> 29:08.840
should take over North Liang.

29:15.540 --> 29:16.540
Yeah.

29:17.815 --> 29:19.615
Perhaps I'm not made for that.

29:25.840 --> 29:27.449
But I wish for a lord in North Liang

29:27.590 --> 29:28.965
like you.

29:33.440 --> 29:34.490
Never trade things off

29:34.765 --> 29:35.765
nor compromise.

29:36.065 --> 29:37.209
It sounds foolish,

29:38.790 --> 29:40.929
but it'd be interesting

29:42.165 --> 29:44.045
to have a person like you
take over North Liang.

30:00.815 --> 30:02.841
(Chunshen Residence)
The whole family moves to North Liang?

30:02.865 --> 30:03.970
Any questions?

30:05.840 --> 30:06.970
This matter is big.

30:07.290 --> 30:09.465
Shouldn't we wait until Lord is back?

30:09.615 --> 30:10.825
It's Mr. Wang's will.

30:10.849 --> 30:12.169
You can ask Miss Wang.

30:12.540 --> 30:13.346
Exactly.

30:13.370 --> 30:14.889
My father ordered you to move now.

30:15.765 --> 30:17.265
It's too hasty.

30:17.515 --> 30:18.691
The belongings

30:18.715 --> 30:20.145
haven't yet been packed up.

30:20.169 --> 30:21.491
Take only money and clothes.

30:21.515 --> 30:22.786
Leave first.

30:22.810 --> 30:24.609
We'll see to the belongings later.

30:24.865 --> 30:25.865
Well...

30:28.290 --> 30:29.890
I'm not lying to you!

30:32.015 --> 30:33.039
That's right.

31:26.115 --> 31:27.115
Hurry.

31:30.165 --> 31:31.165
Come on. Hurry up.

31:31.690 --> 31:32.690
Give me a hand.

31:34.840 --> 31:35.840
Hey.

31:42.740 --> 31:43.740
This room.

31:50.915 --> 31:51.915
Coming.

31:52.090 --> 31:53.114
- Hurry!
- Coming!

31:53.740 --> 31:54.740
Coming.

31:59.890 --> 32:00.890
My lord.

32:03.165 --> 32:04.165
- My lord.
- It...

32:04.540 --> 32:05.169
- My lord.
- Hurry.

32:05.415 --> 32:06.415
Your Highness.

32:08.965 --> 32:10.129
Why are you back?

32:11.565 --> 32:12.740
How did you get out of there?

32:12.765 --> 32:13.970
What's going on?

32:14.040 --> 32:15.415
Mr. Wang, you're late.

32:15.490 --> 32:16.790
A ship has set sail.

32:17.665 --> 32:18.665
What ship?

32:18.740 --> 32:19.890
Where is it heading?

32:20.065 --> 32:20.746
Back to North Liang.

32:20.770 --> 32:21.386
Hurry up.

32:21.410 --> 32:22.391
Who will be back?

32:22.415 --> 32:23.415
Our family.

32:24.340 --> 32:25.716
We can't!

32:25.740 --> 32:26.965
Nearly half people have gone.

32:27.665 --> 32:29.026
The Wang family

32:29.050 --> 32:30.165
cannot leave now.

32:31.690 --> 32:34.209
Who do you think would be the next lord

32:34.409 --> 32:35.666
of North Liang?

32:35.690 --> 32:37.185
No one but you.

32:37.209 --> 32:37.906
In that case,

32:37.930 --> 32:39.790
are you defying my order?

32:40.690 --> 32:41.341
No.

32:41.365 --> 32:42.192
Another two boxes are in that room.

32:42.216 --> 32:43.340
I'm not.

32:43.415 --> 32:44.415
It's...

32:45.290 --> 32:45.967
Don't forget anything.

32:45.991 --> 32:47.990
It's the plan of the General.

32:48.840 --> 32:50.766
Your family shall sacrifice
for my leave from Qingzhou.

32:50.790 --> 32:51.790
Right?

32:52.565 --> 32:53.740
Things have changed.

32:54.015 --> 32:55.340
Xu Xiao has changed his plan.

32:55.615 --> 32:57.565
Your family won't be sacrificed.

32:59.740 --> 33:00.467
This is huge.

33:00.491 --> 33:01.890
I'm not deceiving you.

33:02.290 --> 33:03.145
Get aboard now.

33:03.169 --> 33:03.906
In North Liang,

33:03.930 --> 33:05.490
there are many important tasks for you.

33:05.540 --> 33:06.540
Well...

33:07.365 --> 33:09.140
Will the Lord of Jing'an

33:09.440 --> 33:11.226
allow you to leave Qingzhou?

33:11.250 --> 33:12.791
Xu Xiao has arranged everything.

33:12.815 --> 33:13.516
Two boxes here.

33:13.540 --> 33:14.491
- Leave now
- See if there are other things.

33:14.515 --> 33:15.515
Or you will implicate me.

33:16.240 --> 33:17.160
Don't forget anything.

33:17.184 --> 33:17.810
Listen.

33:17.915 --> 33:19.145
I have a warrant from Xu Xiao.

33:19.169 --> 33:20.169
Let me show you.

33:20.615 --> 33:21.190
Come.

33:21.340 --> 33:22.340
Give me a hand.

33:24.065 --> 33:25.065
Hey, you take that side.

33:25.090 --> 33:26.090
Let me.

33:26.215 --> 33:26.906
Watch it.

33:26.930 --> 33:29.040
Mr. Wang is drunk. Carry him aboard.

33:29.465 --> 33:30.090
Well...

33:30.365 --> 33:31.212
It's been tied up.

33:31.236 --> 33:32.167
Do as he said.

33:32.191 --> 33:33.385
Carry my father aboard

33:33.409 --> 33:34.415
and leave now.

33:35.040 --> 33:36.040
- Yes.
- Yes.

33:48.715 --> 33:50.040
Did you knock my father out?

33:50.415 --> 33:51.415
Or what?

33:51.440 --> 33:52.190
There's nothing here.

33:52.365 --> 33:53.267
Should we

33:53.291 --> 33:54.865
leave him here to get killed?

33:56.165 --> 33:58.290
Alright then.

33:58.790 --> 33:59.790
Um.

34:00.840 --> 34:02.540
Good girl.

34:03.015 --> 34:04.015
Listen.

34:04.040 --> 34:05.166
You should take care of this

34:05.190 --> 34:06.350
and move as soon as possible.

34:06.490 --> 34:07.715
Leave the burdens behind.

34:08.840 --> 34:09.840
Where are you going?

34:09.965 --> 34:10.965
Back to Xiangfan.

34:11.615 --> 34:13.640
Why don't you go back with us?

34:13.815 --> 34:15.215
No, I won't go back to North Liang.

34:15.865 --> 34:17.616
If you go back,

34:17.640 --> 34:19.360
will the Lord of Jing'an
allow you to leave?

34:19.415 --> 34:20.415
I know what to do.

34:22.740 --> 34:23.740
How about

34:23.840 --> 34:25.826
I let Black get you away from Qingzhou?

34:25.850 --> 34:26.866
Qingzhou is vast.

34:26.890 --> 34:28.090
Some places have no waterways.

34:28.715 --> 34:29.715
Moreover,

34:29.740 --> 34:31.490
what about the people in the inn?

34:31.640 --> 34:33.640
How can I leave all of them
to the Lord of Jing'an?

34:35.390 --> 34:36.390
But...

34:36.565 --> 34:37.347
Stop thinking too much.

34:37.371 --> 34:38.665
Or I'll knock you out as well.

34:38.689 --> 34:39.689
Don't you dare!

34:39.715 --> 34:40.452
Another box here.

34:40.476 --> 34:41.591
Leave here as soon as possible.

34:41.615 --> 34:43.790
And take the survivors
in the Lin family.

34:44.690 --> 34:45.850
I know.

34:46.015 --> 34:47.090
Take care.

34:47.615 --> 34:48.615
I'm going.

34:50.990 --> 34:52.410
We'll wait for you in North Liang.

34:52.490 --> 34:53.490
Sure.

34:53.540 --> 34:54.540
Don't die.

34:54.615 --> 34:56.185
I'm waiting for you
to take over North Liang.

34:56.209 --> 34:58.386
And make the world
more interesting, right?

34:58.410 --> 34:59.565
You have my word.

35:02.390 --> 35:03.390
Hey.

35:04.065 --> 35:05.615
Do you need one more maid?

35:05.840 --> 35:06.906
No.

35:06.930 --> 35:07.930
See you.

35:09.290 --> 35:10.290
You fool.

35:18.615 --> 35:20.890
Tofu!

35:32.690 --> 35:34.316
Steamed and fried buns.

35:34.340 --> 35:35.340
This one.

35:35.740 --> 35:36.740
Sure.

35:36.940 --> 35:37.990
I'll pack it up for you.

35:38.390 --> 35:39.740
Pack it in this ebony box.

35:43.490 --> 35:44.691
Put this bracelet

35:44.715 --> 35:46.040
in such a good box?

35:46.615 --> 35:47.740
Yes, I think it's good.

35:53.890 --> 35:55.866
Steamed and fried buns.

35:55.890 --> 35:56.890
Grandpa Wei.

35:57.465 --> 35:58.249
I went back to the inn

35:58.289 --> 35:59.169
and knew you had come out.

35:59.209 --> 36:00.209
So, I'm looking for you.

36:00.240 --> 36:01.249
You're really here.

36:02.865 --> 36:03.865
Have you asked around?

36:04.090 --> 36:05.090
Yes.

36:05.515 --> 36:07.865
Zhao Xun once loved Pei Nanwei,

36:08.515 --> 36:09.515
but later

36:10.065 --> 36:11.986
Lord of Jing'an married her.

36:12.010 --> 36:12.942
After they got married,

36:12.966 --> 36:15.316
Lord of Jing'an adored her.

36:15.340 --> 36:17.026
Not only in Xiangfan,

36:17.050 --> 36:18.129
it's known in Qingzhou

36:18.490 --> 36:21.140
that she is the apple

36:21.390 --> 36:22.629
of his eye.

36:23.040 --> 36:24.040
That's great.

36:24.290 --> 36:24.992
Grandpa Wei.

36:25.016 --> 36:26.566
Go to the Mansion of Lord of Jing'an

36:26.590 --> 36:27.392
and tell him

36:27.416 --> 36:28.416
that this bracelet is a gift from me

36:28.440 --> 36:30.365
to Her Highness.

36:34.115 --> 36:35.115
Wait.

36:38.965 --> 36:40.615
Go get a writing brush and paper.

36:41.090 --> 36:42.390
I'll leave a word

36:43.315 --> 36:44.540
in the box.

36:47.465 --> 36:48.465
Um.

36:59.815 --> 37:01.615
Don't you open it

37:02.915 --> 37:04.990
and see the bracelet from Xu Fengnian?

37:08.365 --> 37:09.465
If you are angry,

37:09.965 --> 37:11.129
I can return it.

37:12.465 --> 37:14.640
Do you think I am

37:15.240 --> 37:16.365
this petty?

37:20.040 --> 37:21.065
Open it.

37:21.665 --> 37:22.940
I also want to see

37:23.190 --> 37:25.090
what kind of bracelet it is.

37:43.365 --> 37:44.729
Made of leftover materials.

37:53.265 --> 37:54.865
Read it by yourself.

38:05.740 --> 38:06.785
Only a small gift.

38:06.809 --> 38:09.609
Please go to the reed marsh
tomorrow afternoon.

38:09.790 --> 38:12.090
I'd like to see you wear it.

38:18.640 --> 38:19.640
Father.

38:21.965 --> 38:23.690
What's with the rush?

38:24.015 --> 38:25.015
The Wangs were gone.

38:25.215 --> 38:26.215
What?

38:26.590 --> 38:28.690
Wang Linquan and his family
ran away by ship.

38:35.690 --> 38:36.690
All his family?

38:37.115 --> 38:38.115
Yes.

38:38.290 --> 38:39.365
They left in a hurry.

38:39.690 --> 38:40.617
When I got the news,

38:40.641 --> 38:42.340
the ship had left Qingzhou.

38:45.965 --> 38:46.965
Should I chase them?

38:49.665 --> 38:52.305
The navy can't leave Qingzhou.

38:52.329 --> 38:53.329
It's military order.

38:54.329 --> 38:55.329
How to chase them?

38:57.640 --> 38:58.640
Where is Xu Fengnian?

38:59.340 --> 39:00.426
He's in the inn.

39:00.450 --> 39:01.740
But he's already packing up.

39:01.990 --> 39:04.290
He said he'd travel east tomorrow.

39:21.815 --> 39:24.010
Since it's from His Highness,

39:25.515 --> 39:26.809
you may accept it.

39:43.315 --> 39:44.415
What about the letter?

39:44.590 --> 39:47.209
He calls me his Uncle.

39:47.490 --> 39:48.490
Tomorrow,

39:49.015 --> 39:50.970
you may go to the reed marsh

39:51.740 --> 39:53.249
and see him off on my behalf.

39:57.165 --> 39:58.540
He's the heir of North Liang.

39:58.865 --> 40:00.169
Don't be rude.

40:02.815 --> 40:03.815
Yes.

40:25.290 --> 40:27.370
Xu Fengnian

40:28.490 --> 40:30.050
has put himself and me

40:30.790 --> 40:32.490
both in an impasse.

40:37.665 --> 40:39.171
Go get the person in the dungeon

40:39.890 --> 40:40.890
here.

41:02.415 --> 41:03.415
Father.

41:03.815 --> 41:05.335
Zhao Kai pays respect to you, my lord.

41:11.215 --> 41:12.315
Tomorrow,

41:12.690 --> 41:14.940
Xu Fengnian will leave.

41:19.515 --> 41:20.690
It doesn't matter

41:21.815 --> 41:23.370
if he leaves or not.

41:23.765 --> 41:24.815
It depends on

41:25.115 --> 41:27.809
whether you want him to leave.

41:30.665 --> 41:32.165
You told me

41:34.390 --> 41:36.190
you were confident to kill him.

41:37.440 --> 41:38.865
I've gathered men

41:39.690 --> 41:41.715
to kill him for you.

41:57.165 --> 41:58.690
Not for me.

42:00.015 --> 42:01.565
It'll be for yourself.

42:02.115 --> 42:03.490
I know nothing.

42:06.315 --> 42:07.465
Yes, my lord.

42:08.370 --> 42:09.640
I'll kill him

42:10.165 --> 42:11.415
for a personal grudge.

42:12.390 --> 42:13.590
It has nothing to do

42:14.915 --> 42:15.915
with Qingzhou.

42:21.115 --> 42:22.115
Then

42:22.465 --> 42:23.465
kill him.

42:24.840 --> 42:26.769
I wonder when and where?

42:29.790 --> 42:31.190
Tomorrow afternoon.

42:31.615 --> 42:33.440
In the reed marsh outside the city.

43:29.870 --> 43:32.590
♪ The flower of pain ♪

43:34.365 --> 43:37.165
♪ Blooms in my heart ♪

43:39.090 --> 43:42.010
♪ I made a bet with the dawn ♪

43:43.090 --> 43:46.890
♪ That you'll answer ♪

43:48.190 --> 43:51.090
♪ Forgive this tragic end ♪

43:52.790 --> 43:55.610
♪ Moved by the moment we met ♪

43:57.615 --> 44:00.370
♪ In spite of thunder and lightning ♪

44:01.390 --> 44:05.315
♪ In spite of my falling ♪

44:05.815 --> 44:08.546
♪ When we are apart ♪

44:08.570 --> 44:09.810
♪ I'll collapse ♪

44:10.590 --> 44:14.450
♪ Capture an image of the memory ♪

44:15.265 --> 44:17.991
♪ After all these ups and downs ♪

44:18.015 --> 44:19.450
♪ The vanity ♪

44:19.940 --> 44:23.815
♪ Who will open it again ♪

44:24.240 --> 44:25.591
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:25.615 --> 44:28.450
♪ It's enough ♪

44:28.865 --> 44:31.346
♪ Drowned in sadness ♪

44:31.370 --> 44:33.770
♪ Just to see through ♪

44:34.065 --> 44:36.091
♪ I will whisper love to you ♪

44:36.115 --> 44:38.291
♪ For a lifetime ♪

44:38.315 --> 44:42.530
♪ End the worry in the world ♪

44:42.890 --> 44:44.026
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:44.050 --> 44:47.090
♪ I'll be there for you all my life ♪

44:47.265 --> 44:49.226
♪ After the moments of beauty ♪

44:49.250 --> 44:51.970
♪ You are my reason to be ♪

44:52.530 --> 44:54.346
♪ If there is a way ♪

44:54.370 --> 44:56.866
♪ To start over ♪

44:56.890 --> 45:00.890
♪ Will you still remember me ♪
